license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An interactive explainer of digital signatures: real ECDSA on secp256k1,
  ECDSA nonce reuse and private key recovery, Lamport one-time signatures, and
  the hash-based post-quantum path through XMSS and FORS to SPHINCS+ (SLH-DSA).
  Code is licensed MIT; content (text, diagrams, screenshots) is licensed
  CC BY 4.0.
keywords:
  - digital signatures
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - ECDSA
  - nonce reuse
  - Lamport
  - SPHINCS+
  - SLH-DSA
  - XMSS
  - education
  - interactive
